// ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ TABLE INPUT ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ {

// --- input text constants ---{

const string IG_TBL_SZPOS        = "▓▓▓▓▓ CONFIG TABLE SIZE AND POSITION  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_TBL_CLRS         = "▓▓▓▓▓ COLORS AND BORDERS ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_TBL_FRMT         = "▓▓▓▓▓ FORMAT  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_DATA         = "▓▓▓▓▓ DATA MATRICES  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_CLRS         = "▓▓▓▓▓ COLOR MATRICES  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_AR_HeaderS         = "▓▓▓▓▓ HEADER ARRAYS  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_CELSZ         = "▓▓▓▓▓ CELL SIZE MATRICES  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_ALIGN        = "▓▓▓▓▓ ALIGN MATRICES  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_TXTSZ        = "▓▓▓▓▓ TEXT SIZE MATRIX  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_FONT         = "▓▓▓▓▓ FONT FAMILY MATRIX  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_TT           = "▓▓▓▓▓ TOOLTIP MATRIX  ▓▓▓▓▓"
const string IG_MX_MERGE        = "▓▓▓▓▓ MERGE MATRIX  ▓▓▓▓▓"



const string TT_TBL_HEIGHT        = "(for width similarly) Overrides table height if cell heights are non zero. E.g. if there are four rows 
  and cell heights are 20 (either as set via cellH or via mxHeight) then if tableHeigh is set to e.g. 50 then cell 
  heights will be 50 * (20 / 80), where 80 is 20*4 = total height of all cells. Works simialar for heights set via 
  mxHeight - determines max sum of heights across all cloumns of mxHeight and adjusts cell heights proportionally to it.
  If cell heights are 0 (i.e. auto-adjust) tableHeight has no effect. "


//}

// --- TABLE SIZE AND POSITION --- {
// i_rows                          = input.int     (group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "rc", defval = 3            , title = "Size: Rows")    
// i_cols                          = input.int     (group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "rc", defval = 5            , title = "Columns")    
i_cfgTblShow                    = input.bool	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "show", defval = true	    , title = "Show config debug table")
i_Ypos							= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "pos", defval = "bottom"	, title = "Position: Y", options= ["bottom", "top", "middle"])
i_Xpos							= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "pos", defval = "right"	    , title = "X", options= ["right", "left", "center"])
i_tableWidth                    = input.float	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "twh", defval = 0			, title = "Table width")
i_tableHeight                   = input.float	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "twh", defval = 0			, title = "Table height", tooltip=TT_TBL_HEIGHT)
i_width							= input.float	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "cwh", defval = 0			, title = "Cell width")
i_height						= input.float	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "cwh", defval = 0			, title = "Cell height")
i_force_overlay					= input.bool	(group = IG_TBL_SZPOS, inline = "ovl",	defval = false		, title = "force_overlay")
//}

// --- TABLE COLORS --- {
i_bgcolor				= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "1", defval =     #fdfd6b			, title = "bgcolor")
i_text_color				= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "1", defval =     #514242			, title = "text_color")
i_colHeadersTxtColor				= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "2", defval =     #514242			, title = "colHeadersTxtColor")
i_colHeadersBgColor				= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "2", defval =     #ecc504			, title = "colHeadersBgColor")
i_rowHeadersTxtColor				= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "3", defval =     #514242			, title = "rowHeadersTxtColor")
i_rowHeadersBgColor				= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "3", defval =     #ecc504			, title = "rowHeadersBgColor")
i_cornerBgClr					= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "4", defval =     #ecc504			, title = "cornerBgClr")
i_cornerTxtClr					= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "4", defval =     #514242			, title = "cornerTxtClr")
i_frame_color					= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "5", defval =     color.black		, title = "frame_color")
i_frame_width					= input.int		(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "5", defval =     1					 , title = "frame_width")
i_border_color					= input.color	(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "6", defval =     color.black	    , title = "border_color")
i_border_width					= input.int		(group = IG_TBL_CLRS, inline = "6", defval =     1					 , title = "border_width")
//}

// --- TABLE FORMAT --- {
i_text_size						= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "1",	defval = size.auto			, title = "text_size", options = [size.auto, size.tiny, size.small, size.normal, size.large, size.huge])
i_font_family					= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "1",	defval = font.family_default    , title = "font_family", options = [font.family_default, font.family_monospace])
i_halign						= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "2",	defval = text.align_left        , title = "halign", options=[text.align_left, text.align_right, text.align_center])
i_valign						= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "2",	defval = text.align_top         , title = "valign", options=[text.align_top, text.align_bottom, text.align_center])
i_string_float_separator		= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "3",	defval = "\n"      			    , title = "string_float_separator")
i_nz							= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "3",	defval = "--"					, title = "nz")
i_format						= input.string	(group = IG_TBL_FRMT, inline = "4",	defval = ""					    , title = "format")
//}



// ▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲ END OF TABLE INPUT  ▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲ }




